Subject: [SL-H04A-R1] Exclude continuation-owned paths from retry seed

Failure observed in retry3:
  retry seed file size differs: subjects/009_S_4324_I1186579/logs/05_select_fod_shells.log

The retry3 seed copied the entire subject logs directory. The approved
select_fod_shells rule then wrote to a copied 05_select_fod_shells.log file.
Each Snakemake worker revalidated the seed and correctly detected that write as
seed drift.

Retry4 correction:
  - seed only subjects/<unit>/00_inputs and subjects/<unit>/01_dwi;
  - exclude logs, 05_model, attempts, contract, publication, and outcomes;
  - require continuation_paths_excluded=true in the seed manifest;
  - keep the exact three-rule allowlist and input/params rerun triggers;
  - retain the 15-unit set, scientific parameters, and resource caps unchanged.

This is an orchestration/provenance-boundary correction. It does not change
imaging data, response-estimation parameters, diagnosis use, or analysis scope.
